cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or these results, please cite the papers below."
title: "QUASAR: QUantum-inspired Anomaly detection with Statistically-Audited Robustness"
abstract: >-
  A matched-scale, matched-dimensionality evaluation of amplitude-encoding
  (quantum-inspired) kernels and calibrated uncertainty quantification for
  security anomaly detection, spanning two case studies: HYQAD (QKD
  physical-layer telemetry) and Q-ZTNA (zero-trust network flows).
